/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQSmhBaGpBTEdjQXR4UmRuMy1KVWY0anJiNkxHQ2NVTjBFbWc4RE5MRk5KU1lzZ1BKMVNKVUNRV3hlRmxtYWc0cmlpSlAxWkJDXzBhdjFqY0RfbE54clBNU1hDODJjbEk2ZENVMWtuM3F6VVZjWGpDZXNhZGowZW1UNUlLWGJSU0tYbXhlYU8xRkYweTJrd1JsM0pDdzd3UkM1ZkpTSXdHYTkxQjNzNlhfU2pTcXExSlFJ?oc=5'&gt;中国华为因伊朗业务在美国刑事审判中被判有罪&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China's Huawei convicted in sprawling US criminal trial over Iran business&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/6c64b8b8-531c-4eea-8fd0-90c4c4967ab9?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;华为在美国审判中被定罪，揭露企业间谍活动和逃避制裁行为&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Huawei convicted in US trial that exposed corporate espionage and sanctions evasion&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQSmhBaGpBTEdjQXR4UmRuMy1KVWY0anJiNkxHQ2NVTjBFbWc4RE5MRk5KU1lzZ1BKMVNKVUNRV3hlRmxtYWc0cmlpSlAxWkJDXzBhdjFqY0RfbE54clBNU1hDODJjbEk2ZENVMWtuM3F6VVZjWGpDZXNhZGowZW1UNUlLWGJSU0tYbXhlYU8xRkYweTJrd1JsM0pDdzd3UkM1ZkpTSXdHYTkxQjNzNlhfU2pTcXExSlFJ?oc=5</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Butterball 首席执行官谈感恩节晚餐展望</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/butterball-ceo-on-thanksgiving-dinner-outlook-video</link><description>Butterball 首席执行官 Jay Jandrain 表示，美国火鸡产量略高于去年，节日火鸡价格与往年基本一致。一些零售商提供的火鸡优惠价格低于去年的价格，感恩节餐篮的价格可能与去年相同或更低。詹德瑞恩表示，零售商决定是否对产品打折以吸引购物者，而巴特鲍尔则对促销活动表示欢迎。他在“The Close”节目中与罗曼·博斯蒂克进行了交谈。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/butterball-ceo-on-thanksgiving-dinner-outlook-video'&gt;Butterball 首席执行官谈感恩节晚餐展望&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Butterball CEO on Thanksgiving Dinner Outlook&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/butterball-ceo-on-thanksgiving-dinner-outlook-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:12:17 +0000</pubDate></